{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"faction_dailies/menus/12010536_1_5.en.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_12010536:1:5","lang":"en","texts":{"menu:4047520:1":{"text":"Wow, these fish are unique... I wonder if they're jawless or cartilaginous.","source_cn":"喔！这些鱼很奇特……不知道是无颌鱼还是软骨鱼。","status":"exact_duplicate_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:冬青学者佛瑞丝":{"text":"Scholar Floris","source":"冬青学者佛瑞丝","status":"exact_hash"}}},"faction_dailies/menus/12010536_1_8.en.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_12010536:1:8","lang":"en","texts":{"menu:4043090:1":{"text":"The view here is spectacular! That one is Altair...\nWe'll be able to see Alpha Pegasi and Beta Pegasi sometime later.","source_cn":"这里视野很好！这是河鼓二……\n再过段时间，就能看到室宿一和室宿二了。","status":"exact_duplicate_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:冬青学者阿尔瓦":{"text":"Scholar Alvin","source":"冬青学者阿尔瓦","status":"exact_hash"}}},"locales/en/ep2/quest_story/12246370.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246370","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12246370","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1224637001:0":{"text":"Some Evergreen Conservatory scholars have arrived in Rustport recently. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, could you help me entertain them?","source_cn":"最近锈锚港来了一批冬青学者，<style=stress...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2C244B7987657713","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Some Evergreen Conservatory scholars have arrived in Rustport recently. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, could you help me entertain them?","female":"Some Evergreen Conservatory scholars have arrived in Rustport recently. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, could you help me entertain them?","variant_male_record_index":"141392","variant_female_record_index":"141393","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1224637002:1":{"text":"We roughnecks aren't good at dealing with those scholars.","source_cn":"血薇帮都是些粗人，不擅长和学者打交道。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3B76B67AC6FBB77A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We roughnecks aren't good at dealing with those scholars.","female":"We roughnecks aren't good at dealing with those scholars.","variant_male_record_index":"141394","variant_female_record_index":"141395","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1224637003:1":{"text":"I believe you're the only one fit for the role.","source_cn":"我想，合适的人，只有你了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x61ABE18D6D8F5F6D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I believe you're the only one fit for the role.","female":"I believe you're the only one fit for the role.","variant_male_record_index":"141396","variant_female_record_index":"141397","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卢卡":{"text":"Lucca","source":"卢卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/en/ep2/quest_story/12246380.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246380","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12246380","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1224638001:0":{"text":"W—What kind of strange creature is this?!","source_cn":"这、这是什么奇怪的生物！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC34108111B90AAB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1224638002:0":{"text":"Target found, Magister!","source_cn":"主人，发现目标了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6834655C41D94534","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Target found, Magister!","female":"Target found, Magister!","variant_male_record_index":"141399","variant_female_record_index":"141400","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:冬青学者韦恩":{"text":"Scholar Wain","source":"冬青学者韦恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/en/ep2/quest_story/12246390.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246390","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12246390","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1224639001:1":{"text":"Look, Dori! What a groundbreaking discovery!","source_cn":"这个生物——丝道瑞，这是突破性的发现！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D27FE08F90C9485","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1224639002:1":{"text":"A study on this creature will surely get funded.","source_cn":"它作为课题，这份报告一定能申请到基金。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEB0198548450BAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1224639003:1":{"text":"What a fruitful trip! I've found a direction for our papers and projects!","source_cn":"不虚此行！我们的论文和项目有着落了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EF905D35CCEAFB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1224639004:1":{"text":"Are these scholars using a Graveborn as a specimen? How bold!","source_cn":"这帮学者胆子真大，居然把亡灵当标本研究。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDE32A2D5D1ED9CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1224639005:0":{"text":"I heard there are some marine biology scholars at Blackwood Loch. Let's check in with them.","source_cn":"听说还有研究鱼类的学者在黑木湖，我们快去看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16711BB289A5F8BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:冬青学者韦恩":{"text":"Scholar Wain","source":"冬青学者韦恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:冬青学者丝道瑞":{"text":"Scholar Dori","source":"冬青学者丝道瑞","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":4}},"locales/en/ep2/quest_story/12246400.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246400","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12246400","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1224640001:0":{"text":"Magister, let's head to Blackwood Loch!","source_cn":"主人，去黑木湖吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC5E6660DD962DA60","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister, let's head to Blackwood Loch!","female":"Magister, let's head to Blackwood Loch!","variant_male_record_index":"141407","variant_female_record_index":"141408","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/en/ep2/quest_story/12246410.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246410","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12246410","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1224641001:0":{"text":"Are they here to study the grass carp and thornbass?","source_cn":"他们是来黑木湖研究苔鲤和枯刺鲈吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x948F2CF0F619F017","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/en/ep2/quest_story/12246420.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246420","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12246420","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1224642001:0":{"text":"They look like carp, but they also exhibit some characteristics of cichlids.","source_cn":"看起来是鲤科，但是也有点儿慈鲷科的特征……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87D7946307980588","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1224642002:1":{"text":"It'd be great if we could study them up close... Could you help me catch some?","source_cn":"如果能近距离研究就好了……您能帮我钓几条吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF6CF7697AB2AF03E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It'd be great if we could study them up close... Could you help me catch some?","female":"It'd be great if we could study them up close... Could you help me catch some?","variant_male_record_index":"141411","variant_female_record_index":"141412","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_f